  "description": "Fourstroke 01 is an XCO performance bike that exceeds the demands of the world’s top racers. On a mission to set the pace with our unique Autodrop technology and unrivalled APS dual-link suspension with 100mm of front and rear travel, it bests the competition in a Premium Carbon frame. This revolutionized racing machine arrives with integrated protection and is designed around the progressive BMC geometry, now accommodating two water bottles in the front triangle for long-distance missions. Fourstroke 01 ONE is a medal winning machine with a SRAM X01 Eagle AXS drivetrain, RockShox SID Ultimate fork and RockShox SIDLuxe Ultimate shock, DT Swiss XRC 1501 wheels and the BMC Autodrop integrated dropper seatpost.",
